          },
          "description": "Classic story of Mowgli, the young boy raised by wolves in India: his escapades & adventures with his dear friends Bagheera the panther & Baloo the bear, his capture by the Monkey-People, his attempt at reintegration into human society, & his ultimate triumph over his avowed enemy the tiger Shere Khan. Included in the book is the story of the brave white seal, Kotick, and the tenacious young mongoose, Rikki-Tikki-Tavi who battled through the night to protect his human family from cobras. ",
